{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51570","headline":"答崔素娥（《全唐诗》名媛有崔素娥《别韦洵美诗》，韦诗以小字附後。） · 韦洵美","name":"答崔素娥（《全唐诗》名媛有崔素娥《别韦洵美诗》，韦诗以小字附後。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别恨商羣离羣自古闻，此心难舍意难论。\n承恩必若颁时服，莫使沾濡有泪痕。\n（《全五代诗》八详引《侍儿小名录》（韦洵美二诗，皆出自《灯下闲谈》卷下《行者雪怨》。\n「离羣」，《灯下闲谈》作「离情」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦洵美","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}